tor </c><00:00:02.488><c>theta </c><00:00:02.491><c>but  </c><00:00:02.494><c>this </c><00:00:02.497><c>integral </c><00:00:02.500><c>should </c><00:00:02.503><c>be </c><00:00:02.506><c>once </c><00:00:02.509><c>more </c><00:00:02.512><c>over  </c><00:00:02.515><c>all </c><00:00:02.518><c>the </c><00:00:02.521><c>parameters </c><00:00:02.524><c>so </c><00:00:02.527><c>it </c><00:00:02.530><c>would </c><00:00:02.533><c>be </c><00:00:02.536><c>a  </c><00:00:02.539><c>multi-dimensional </c><00:00:02.542><c>integral </c><00:00:02.545><c>in </c><00:00:02.548><c>the  </c><00:00:02.551><c>general </c><00:00:02.554><c>case </c><00:00:02.557><c>and </c><00:00:02.560><c>that's </c><00:00:02.563><c>one </c><00:00:02.566><c>additional  </c><00:00:02.569><c>source </c><00:00:02.572><c>of </c><00:00:02.575><c>difficulty </c><00:00:02.578><c>and </c><00:00:02.581><c>this </c><00:00:02.584><c>is </c><00:00:02.587><c>the  </c><00:00:02.590><c>reason </c><00:00:02.593><c>why </c><00:00:02.596><c>we </c><00:00:02.599><c>will </c><00:00:02.602><c>also </c><00:00:02.605><c>consider </c><00:00:02.608><c>an  </c><00:00:02.611><c>alternative </c><00:00:02.614><c>to </c><00:00:02.617><c>list </c><00:00:02.620><c>min </c><00:00:02.623><c>squares  </c><00:00:02.626><c>estimation </c><00:00:02.629><c>which </c><00:00:02.632><c>is </c><00:00:02.635><c>much </c><00:00:02.638><c>simpler  </c><00:00:02.641><c>computationally </c><00:00:02.644><c>and </c><00:00:02.647><c>much </c><00:00:02.650><c>less </c><00:00:02.653><c>demanding  </c><00:00:02.656><c>in </c><00:00:02.659><c>terms </c><00:00:02.662><c>of </c><00:00:02.665><c>the </c><00:00:02.668><c>model </c><00:00:02.671><c>that </c><00:00:02.674><c>we </c><00:00:02.677><c>need </c><00:00:02.680><c>to  </c><00:00:02.683><c>have </c><00:00:02.686><c>in </c><00:00:02.689><c>our </c><00:00:02.692><c>hands</c>

